+# Xbox 360 startup media
+
+The Xbox 360 startup animation, logo and audio are Microsoft material. These
+media files are separate from the HomeNX code's GPL-3.0 license; that software
+license does not grant rights to Microsoft's artwork or audio.
+
+Source recording: ZivvoZ/dashx360, `Assets/Boot/Blades Startup.mp4`, Git blob
+`617b003906e131c87c636696efebd219fb0286ef`.
+https://github.com/ZivvoZ/dashx360/blob/main/Assets/Boot/Blades%20Startup.mp4
+
+SHA-256: `49167ff153513d9e3e9d89b80cf63522d67a1bb28f547bd81ff748c338f920a8`.
+`startup-nxe-source.mp4` is the unchanged downloaded recording.
+`projects/cards/romfs/boot/nxe360.bin` contains derived lossless 720p frames and
+PCM sound. The conversion script and complete per-frame verification report
+are included. Nintendo and Microsoft do not endorse this project.
